	quest.02B94A9FEA1456BB.title: "Vesper: 5 次击杀"
	quest.02BD590D1F903E73.quest_desc: [
		"&e&l功能说明&r"
		"&f掌握后可切换，用中毒效果强化你的攻击。&r"
		""
		"&a&l获取方法&r"
		""
		"&f1. 选择或进化为以下列出的种族之一。该种族会自动授予此技能。&r"
		""
		"&f2. 自动获取检查：使用/吃掉100个蜘蛛之眼，或杀死100个tensura:black_spider。满足条件后触发一次常规EP更新（例如击败其他生物），以便TenSura重新评估可学习的技能。&r"
		""
		"&f3. 用Gluttony从下面的生物中偷取。要么让该生物成为你的下属并使用Gluttony的技能获取模式，要么用Corrosion模式将其杀死。此方法仅适用于允许的Common、Extra、Intrinsic或Resistance技能，其他模组仍可能阻止该尝试。&r"
		""
		"&6&l使用它的生物&r"
		"&fAqua Frog (tensura:aqua_frog); Army Wasp (tensura:army_wasp); Cave Spider (minecraft:cave_spider); Phantaspore (tensura:phantaspore); Pufferfish (minecraft:pufferfish)&r"
		"&8拥有技能的生物不保证会掉落。请使用上述的学习方法之一。&r"
		""
		"&d&l授予它的种族&r"
		"&f深渊地精 (trarcane:abyssal_tiefling); 神圣象鼻蝎 (mysticism:divine_loxodrome_scorpion); 神圣奇点蝎 (mysticism:divine_singularity_scorpion); 重力灵魂虫 (mysticism:gravity_soul_insect); 象鼻蝎 (mysticism:loxodrome_scorpion); 象鼻蝎虫群 (mysticism:loxodrome_scorpion_insectar)&r"
		"&fLoxodrome Scorpion Savant (mysticism:loxodrome_scorpion_savant); Poison Soul Insect (mysticism:poison_soul_insect); Salamander (trnightmare:salamander); Salamander Assassin (trnightmare:salamander_assassin); Salamander Fire Spirit (trnightmare:salamander_fire_spirit); Salamander Fire Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:salamander_fire_dragon)&r"
		"&fSalamander Poison Spirit (trnightmare:salamander_poison_spirit); Salamander Poison Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:salamander_poison_dragon); Salamander Warlock (trnightmare:salamander_warlock); Scorpion (mysticism:scorpion); Singularity Scorpion (mysticism:singularity_scorpion); Singularity Scorpion Insectar (mysticism:singularity_scorpion_insectar)&r"
		"&fSingularity Scorpion Savant (mysticism:singularity_scorpion_savant)&r"
		""
		"&3&l任务追踪&r"
		"&f• 学习：中毒 — 学习后完成&r"
		"&8这些任务仅追踪进度，不会授予或提升任何技能。&r"
	]
	quest.02BD590D1F903E73.quest_subtitle: "通用技能 • 十束：转生者"
