	quest.132B1BE16B691D29.quest_subtitle: "进化 • 神秘主义"
	quest.132B1BE16B691D29.title: "硬壳蚂蚁"
	quest.135840EC40348777.quest_desc: [
		"&e&l功能说明&r"
		"&fMelt into the shadows and move unseen by all but the most keen observers.&r"
		""
		"&a&l获取方法&r"
		""
		"&f1. 必杀许可（默认配置）：击败 tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight；Skill Obtain 模组将以 100% 默认概率授予此技能。&r"
		""
		"&f2. 选择或进化为以下列出的种族之一。该种族会自动授予此技能。&r"
		""
		"&f3. 用Gluttony从下面的生物中偷取。要么让该生物成为你的下属并使用Gluttony的技能获取模式，要么用Corrosion模式将其杀死。此方法仅适用于允许的Common、Extra、Intrinsic或Resistance技能，其他模组仍可能阻止该尝试。&r"
		""
		"&6&l使用它的生物&r"
		"&f末影人 (minecraft:enderman); 利姆露·坦佩斯特 (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight)&r"
		"&8拥有技能的生物不保证会掉落。请使用上述的学习方法之一。&r"
		""
		"&d&l授予它的种族&r"
		"&fAmped Guitar Wolf (mysticism:amped_guitar_wolf); Antumbra Spirit Wolf (mysticism:antumbra_spirit_wolf); Apostle (trnightmare:apostle); Apostle (trvirtuoso:apostle); Black Fang (mysticism:black_fang); Blazing Scorch Wolf (mysticism:blazing_scorch_wolf)&r"
		"&f蓝牙 (mysticism:blue_fang); 棕牙 (mysticism:brown_fang); 腐化龙 (ascension:corrupted_dragon); 腐化龙裔 (ascension:corrupted_dragonkin); 诅咒龙 (ascension:cursed_dragon); 黑暗牙 (mysticism:darkness_fang)&r"
		"&fDemon Dragon God (ascension:demon_dragon_god); Demonic Dragon (ascension:demonic_dragon); Direwolf (mysticism:direwolf); Disciple (trnightmare:disciple); Disciple (trvirtuoso:disciple); Divine Vampire (tensura:divine_vampire)&r"
		"&f神圣狼 (mysticism:divine_wolf); 霜狼 (mysticism:frost_wolf); 冰川灵魂狼 (mysticism:glacier_spirit_wolf); 绿牙狼 (mysticism:green_fang); 吉他狼 (mysticism:guitar_wolf); 隐士 (trnightmare:hermit)&r"
		"&fHermit (trvirtuoso:hermit); Jedidiah (trnightmare:jedidiah); Jedidiah (trvirtuoso:jedidiah); Light Fang (mysticism:light_fang); Magic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:gale_spirit_wolf); Magic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:magic_spirit_wolf)&r"
		"&f魔法精神狼 (mysticism:ocean_spirit_wolf); 熔岩精神狼 (mysticism:molten_spirit_wolf); 山岳精神狼 (mysticism:mountain_spirit_wolf); 神秘黑牙 (mysticism:mystical_black_fang); 神秘黑牙 (mysticism:mystical_blue_fang); 神秘棕牙 (mysticism:mystical_brown_fang)&r"
		"&f神秘黑暗獠牙 (mysticism:mystical_darkness_fang); 神秘绿色獠牙 (mysticism:mystical_green_fang); 神秘光明獠牙 (mysticism:mystical_light_fang); 神秘紫色獠牙 (mysticism:mystical_purple_fang); 神秘红色獠牙 (mysticism:mystical_red_fang); 雪狼 (mysticism:nivalis_frost_wolf)&r"
		"&fPenumbra Spirit Wolf (mysticism:penumbra_spirit_wolf); Planet Spirit Wolf (mysticism:planet_spirit_wolf); Purple Fang (mysticism:purple_fang); Red Fang (mysticism:red_fang); Scorch Wolf (mysticism:scorch_wolf); Sorcerer (trnightmare:sorcerer)&r"
		"&f巫师 (trvirtuoso:sorcerer); 星狼 (mysticism:star_wolf); 风暴灵魂狼 (mysticism:storm_spirit_wolf); 弦魂狼 (mysticism:string_spirit_wolf); 风暴星狼 (mysticism:tempest_star_wolf); 吸血鬼 (tensura:vampire)&r"
		"&fVampire Lord (tensura:vampire_lord); Vampire Overcomer (tensura:vampire_overcomer); Volcanic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:volcanic_spirit_wolf)&r"
		""
		"&3&l任务追踪&r"
		"&f• 学习：暗影运动 — 学习后完成&r"
		"&8这些任务仅追踪进度，不会授予或提升任何技能。&r"
	]
