	quest.2898AE5550780247.quest_desc: [
		"&e&l功能说明&r"
		"&f多种元素光环，让你的攻击更强大。&r"
		""
		"&a&l获取方法&r"
		""
		"&f1. 选择或进化为以下列出的种族之一。该种族会自动授予此技能。&r"
		""
		"&f2. 自动获取检查：将相关计数器达到7前掌握魔法。满足条件后（例如击败其他生物）触发常规EP更新，以便TenSura重新评估可学习的技能。&r"
		""
		"&d&l授予它的种族&r"
		"&f大天使 (ascension:archangel); 混沌神 (ascension:chaotic_deity); 承包商 (trnightmare:contractor); 承包商 (trvirtuoso:contractor); 宇宙神 (ascension:cosmic_deity); 神圣天使 (ascension:divine_angel)&r"
		"&fEnforcer (trnightmare:enforcer); Enforcer (trvirtuoso:enforcer); Fallen Angel (ascension:fallen_angel); Myrddin (trnightmare:myrddin); Myrddin (trvirtuoso:myrddin); Seraphim (ascension:seraphim)&r"
		"&fTrickster (trnightmare:trickster); Trickster (trvirtuoso:trickster); Wanderer (trnightmare:wanderer); Wanderer (trvirtuoso:wanderer)&r"
		""
		""
		"&6&l使用它的生物&r"
		"&fAlpha Yeti (twilightforest:alpha_yeti); Amethyst Crab (cataclysm:amethyst_crab); Ancient Remnant (cataclysm:ancient_remnant); Ender Guardian (cataclysm:ender_guardian); Frostmaw (mowziesmobs:frostmaw); Hydra (twilightforest:hydra); Ignis (cataclysm:ignis); Infernal Dragon (block_factorys_bosses:infernal_dragon); Knight Phantom (twilightforest:knight_phantom); Lich (twilightforest:lich); Maledictus (cataclysm:maledictus); Minoshroom (twilightforest:minoshroom); Naga (mowziesmobs:naga); Naga (twilightforest:naga); Netherite Monstrosity (cataclysm:netherite_monstrosity); Sandworm (block_factorys_bosses:sandworm); Sculptor (mowziesmobs:sculptor); Scylla (cataclysm:scylla); Slider (aether:slider); Snow Queen (twilightforest:snow_queen); Sun Spirit (aether:sun_spirit); The Harbinger (cataclysm:the_harbinger); The Leviathan (cataclysm:the_leviathan); Umvuthi (mowziesmobs:umvuthi); Underworld Knight (block_factorys_bosses:underworld_knight); Ur Ghast (twilightforest:ur_ghast); Valkyrie Queen (aether:valkyrie_queen); Yeti (block_factorys_bosses:yeti)&r"
		"&3&l任务追踪&r"
		"&f• 学习：魔法光环 — 学习后完成&r"
		"&8这些任务仅追踪进度，不会授予或提升任何技能。&r"
	]
