		""
		"&6&l使用它的生物&r"
		"&fGravebound Colossus (elitetensura:gravebound_colossus); Amethyst Crab (cataclysm:amethyst_crab); Ancient Remnant (cataclysm:ancient_remnant); Armored Giant (twilightforest:armored_giant); Ferrous Wroughtnaut (mowziesmobs:ferrous_wroughtnaut); Kobolediator (cataclysm:kobolediator); Koboleton (cataclysm:koboleton); Modern Remnant (cataclysm:modern_remnant); Naga (twilightforest:naga); Netherite Monstrosity (cataclysm:netherite_monstrosity); Slider (aether:slider); Wadjet (cataclysm:wadjet)&r"
		"&8拥有技能的生物不保证会掉落。请使用上述的学习方法之一。&r"
