	quest.3B42FB8D5F2F93E4.title: "愤怒的亡者之王：首次击杀"
	quest.3B4860EDE7F68723.quest_desc: [
		"&e&l功能说明&r"
		"&fBuild relationships with nearby friendable entities through choices, gifts, and trust.&r"
		""
		"&a&l获取方法&r"
		""
		"&f1. 达到200,000 EP，然后触发一次正常的EP更新。TR: Nightmare会自动授予友谊，并解锁其龙的友谊系统。&r"
