	quest.6663EDBEFD21E23F.quest_subtitle: "进化 • 恐怖传说：噩梦"
	quest.6663EDBEFD21E23F.title: "大地之牙 Fang of Earth"
	quest.6689BF4D0BF99185.quest_desc: [
		"&e&l功能说明&r"
		"&f忽略较弱的火焰伤害，或降低较强热源造成的伤害。&r"
		""
		"&a&l获取方法&r"
		""
		"&f1. 选择或进化为以下列出的种族之一。该种族会自动授予此技能。&r"
		""
		"&f2. 用Gluttony从下面的生物中偷取。要么让该生物成为你的下属并使用Gluttony的技能获取模式，要么用Corrosion模式将其杀死。此方法仅适用于允许的Common、Extra、Intrinsic或Resistance技能，其他模组仍可能阻止该尝试。&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins 真龙之路线：&f成为真龙族并获得一个未占用的元素席位。该模组会随机分配一个可用的深渊、大地、灼烧、霜冻或风暴席位；获得灼烧席位将自动授予此技能。每个元素席位在每个世界中只能有一个所有者，因此此路线在已建立的服务器上无法可靠地定向完成。&r"
		""
		"&6&l使用它的生物&r"
		"&fCarrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Gazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Hinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi); Memoires (mysticism:memoires); Warden (minecraft:warden); Cinder Adder (cataclysm:cinder_adder); Fire Minion (aether:fire_minion); Tower Ghast (twilightforest:tower_ghast); Umvuthana Raptor (mowziesmobs:umvuthana_raptor); Ur Ghast (twilightforest:ur_ghast)&r"
		"&8拥有技能的生物不保证会掉落。请使用上述的学习方法之一。&r"
		""
		"&d&l授予它的种族&r"
		"&fCharged Perforator (mysticism:charged_perforator); Demon Slime (tensura:demon_slime); Dissonance Deity (mysticism:dissonance_deity); Divine Netherite Dragon (trnightmare:divine_netherite_dragon); Enflamed Aberration (mysticism:enflamed_aberration); God Slime (tensura:god_slime)&r"
		"&fLesser Nether Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_nether_dragon); Lightning Aberration (mysticism:lightning_aberration); Magma Worm (mysticism:magma_worm); Medium Nether Dragon (trnightmare:medium_nether_dragon); Metal Slime (tensura:metal_slime); Molten Perforator (mysticism:molten_perforator)&r"
		"&f下界合金龙 (trnightmare:netherite_dragon); 过载蠕虫 (mysticism:overloading_worm); 焦尾蝾螈 (mysticism:scorchtail_salamander); 焦尾翼龙 (mysticism:scorchtalon_wyvern); 废料龙 (trnightmare:scrap_dragon); 暴力神 (mysticism:violence_deity)&r"
		""
		"&3&l任务追踪&r"
		"&f• 学习：耐热性 — 学习后完成&r"
		"&8这些任务仅追踪进度，不会授予或提升任何技能。&r"
	]
